{
  "file": "module5",
  "page": 76,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        66.76272583007812,
        223.77130126953125,
        82.6147232055664
      ],
      "text": "Monitoring and evaluation",
      "font": "SegoeUI-BoldItalic",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        89.82263946533203,
        527.4056396484375,
        104.26564025878906
      ],
      "text": "In children, smear and culture monitoring of the response to treatment may be challenging, due to",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        103.02259063720703,
        527.5598754882812,
        117.46559143066406
      ],
      "text": "difficulties in obtaining appropriate specimens for testing, for the same reasons it is difficult to obtain a",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.971061706542969,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        116.22272491455078,
        527.2203369140625,
        130.6657257080078
      ],
      "text": "bacteriological confirmation of the diagnosis. In children with a bacteriologically confirmed diagnosis,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.98784351348877,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        129.42274475097656,
        527.0858154296875,
        143.86573791503906
      ],
      "text": "all reasonable efforts should be taken to demonstrate bacteriological conversion. Once cultures have",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.98889446258545,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        142.62269592285156,
        527.576904296875,
        157.06568908691406
      ],
      "text": "become negative or in children who never had a confirmed diagnosis, repeated respiratory sampling",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.990195274353027,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        155.8227081298828,
        527.3782958984375,
        170.2657012939453
      ],
      "text": "may not be useful if the child is otherwise responding well clinically. Resolution of clinical symptoms",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        169.02272033691406,
        527.4411010742188,
        183.46571350097656
      ],
      "text": "and weight gain can be used as indicators of improvement. All children should have regular clinical",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        182.2227325439453,
        527.4367065429688,
        196.6657257080078
      ],
      "text": "follow-up, including weight and height monitoring. Drug dosages should be adjusted with weight",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        195.42274475097656,
        149.0980987548828,
        209.86573791503906
      ],
      "text": "gain, as needed.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        217.12660217285156,
        527.3530883789062,
        231.56959533691406
      ],
      "text": "The risk of emergence of delamanid resistance should be a key consideration when the drug is",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        230.3267364501953,
        527.3838500976562,
        244.7697296142578
      ],
      "text": "being used. Due to the difficulties in obtaining a suitable sample from children aged below 3 years,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        243.52662658691406,
        527.4334106445312,
        257.9696350097656
      ],
      "text": "performing DST may be challenging. However, if there are concerns about acquired drug resistance,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        256.7266845703125,
        527.3826904296875,
        271.1697082519531
      ],
      "text": "every effort should be made to obtain a suitable sample, such as through gastric aspirate, sputum",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        269.9266357421875,
        154.2141876220703,
        284.3696594238281
      ],
      "text": "induction or NPA.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        291.630615234375,
        527.460693359375,
        306.0736389160156
      ],
      "text": "No cardiac safety signals distinct from those reported in adults were observed in children 0–2 years of",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.97983169555664,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        304.83062744140625,
        527.3837280273438,
        319.2736511230469
      ],
      "text": "age; however, these are largely based on subtherapeutic concentrations. Given that a QTc evaluation",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        318.03057861328125,
        527.2595825195312,
        332.4736022949219
      ],
      "text": "prior to delamanid administration may not always be feasible, it may be important to adapt risk",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        331.2305908203125,
        527.4111938476562,
        345.6736145019531
      ],
      "text": "mitigation strategies when administering delamanid in combination with other agents that prolong",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        344.43060302734375,
        266.9345397949219,
        358.8736267089844
      ],
      "text": "QTc (such as electrolytes which are stable).",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        366.1344909667969,
        527.416748046875,
        380.5775146484375
      ],
      "text": "Monitoring the emergence of neuropsychiatric effects (including hallucinations) in children treated",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        379.3345031738281,
        527.4774169921875,
        393.77752685546875
      ],
      "text": "with delamanid – both who are admitted to hospitals and treated in households – will be very",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        392.5345153808594,
        527.4420776367188,
        406.9775390625
      ],
      "text": "important. Particular attention should be paid to children who are receiving other medications that",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        405.7344970703125,
        527.4244995117188,
        420.1775207519531
      ],
      "text": "have known neuropsychiatric effects, such as cycloserine. Therefore, active TB drug safety monitoring",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.986641883850098,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        418.93450927734375,
        527.4474487304688,
        433.3775329589844
      ],
      "text": "and management systems must be functional to detect, manage and report suspected or confirmed",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        432.1344909667969,
        223.78990173339844,
        446.5775146484375
      ],
      "text": "drug toxicities in a timely manner.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        453.8385009765625,
        527.5982666015625,
        468.2815246582031
      ],
      "text": "Recording and reporting of details on the diagnosis, treatment regimens, clinical monitoring and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        467.03839111328125,
        527.4344482421875,
        481.4814147949219
      ],
      "text": "treatment outcomes of children and adolescents with MDR/RR-TB is important for monitoring the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        480.2384948730469,
        527.2178955078125,
        494.6815185546875
      ],
      "text": "programmatic implementation of newly recommended regimens as well as for efforts to improve case",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.968404769897461,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        493.43841552734375,
        527.4147338867188,
        507.8814392089844
      ],
      "text": "finding of children with DR-TB. Data from national programmes on the use of delamanid in children",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        506.6385498046875,
        313.0439758300781,
        521.08154296875
      ],
      "text": "of all ages is important to expand the evidence base.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        41.23320007324219,
        801.0170288085938,
        136.43409729003906,
        811.52099609375
      ],
      "text": "52 WHO consolidated",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        136.43649291992188,
        801.0170288085938,
        170.0604705810547,
        811.52099609375
      ],
      "text": "guidelines",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        170.06539916992188,
        801.0170288085938,
        450.3536071777344,
        811.52099609375
      ],
      "text": "on tuberculosis, Module 5: Management of tuberculosis in children and adolescents",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
